#: includes/tabs/tab-settings-revplus.php:24
msgid ""
"The name before .reserve-online.net in the booking engine address: https://"
"<Property name>.reserve-online.net/. When the booking engine is on an "
"address of the property, such as book.myhotel.com, that address points to a "
"reserve-online.net one: the property name is the one to enter here."
msgstr ""
"El nombre antes de .reserve-online.net en la dirección del motor de "
"reservas: https://<Property name>.reserve-online.net/. Cuando el motor de "
"reservas está en una dirección del alojamiento, como book.myhotel.com, esa "
