"el que hay que indicar aquí."

#: includes/tabs/tab-settings-revplus.php:40
msgid "property"
msgstr "property"

#: includes/tabs/tab-settings-revplus.php:41
msgid ""
"Optional: the code of the hotel to open, for accounts with more than one. "
"Empty searches all of them. A wrong code gives a \"page not found\" error."
msgstr ""
"Opcional: el código del hotel que se abrirá, para cuentas con más de uno. "
