"Enable Infants only if your property accepts them: a property for adults "
"only ignores these values, and guests would choose them for nothing. The age "
"ranges are the ones configured in your RevPlus booking engine."
msgstr ""
"Activa Bebés solo si tu alojamiento los admite: un alojamiento solo para "
