msgstr "Vale"

#: includes/tabs/tab-settings-roiback.php:24
msgid ""
"The address of your Roiback booking engine, which is usually on your own "
"domain: https://reservas.myhotel.com. The whole address can be pasted."
msgstr ""
"La dirección de tu motor de reservas Roiback, que suele estar en tu propio "
"dominio: https://reservas.myhotel.com. Se puede pegar la dirección entera."

